{"rank": 40, "root": "دخل", "form": 1, "lemma": "دَخَلَ", "count": 76, "ayahCount": 67, "share": 0.39, "meaning": {"bs": "ući", "en": "to enter", "tr": "girmek", "fr": "entrer", "id": "masuk", "ur": "داخل ہونا", "bn": "প্রবেশ করা", "fa": "وارد شدن"}, "lemmaSpoken": "audio/33e0b5e1638e3c529dff.m4a", "animation": "<svg class=\"va va-dakhala_1\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 120 72\"><style> @keyframes dks{from{transform:rotate(-24deg)}}@keyframes dkt{from{transform:rotate(24deg)}}@keyframes dkm{from{transform:translateX(-72px)}}.va-dakhala_1 .ll,.va-dakhala_1 .ra{transform:rotate(24deg);animation:dks .5s ease-in-out 5 alternate both}.va-dakhala_1 .rl,.va-dakhala_1 .la{transform:rotate(-24deg);animation:dkt .5s ease-in-out 5 alternate both}.va-dakhala_1 .fig{animation:dkm 2.5s linear both}.f,.p{fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round}.f{stroke:var(--accent);stroke-width:4.5}.t{stroke-width:8}.h{fill:var(--accent)}.p{stroke:var(--gold);stroke-width:3}.q{fill:var(--gold)}.va-dakhala_1.off,.va-dakhala_1.off *{animation:none!important}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.va-dakhala_1,.va-dakhala_1 *{animation:none!important}}</style><path class=\"p\" d=\"M6 61H114M84 60V30h28v30M81 32l17-14 17 14\"/><g transform=\"translate(98 44)\"><g class=\"fig\"><g class=\"ll\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"rl\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v17\"/></g><g class=\"tr\"><path class=\"f t\" d=\"M0 0V-17\"/><circle class=\"h\" cy=\"-26\" r=\"6.5\"/><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"la\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g><g transform=\"translate(0 -15)\"><g class=\"ra\"><path class=\"f\" d=\"M0 0v14\"/></g></g></g></g></g></svg> ", "principal": [{"tense": "past", "pronoun": "huwa", "arabic": "دَخَلَ", "plain": "دَخَلَ", "quran": true, "notUsed": false, "spoken": "audio/33e0b5e1638e3c529dff.m4a", "recited": "audio/29e99bbe1f93a05f79c7.m4a", "recitedText": "دَخَلَ"}, {"tense": "present", "pronoun": "huwa", "arabic": "يَدْخُلُ